== Quest Start ==
Talk to Sarkis Ebonblade in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Sarkis Ebonblade'
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says, 'Greetings, Tify.  Have you come here to test your [dark powers] of skill and spell casting?' ''
You say, 'dark powers'
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says, 'I have tests of your dark powers, whether you be of an enlightened mind, or not.  For the simple minds, we have the tests of [bash], [smash] and [slash]. For the more refined among us, there are the tests of [disempowerment], [envenoming], [raising of the dead], and [necropotence]. Choose wisely.' ''

